  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equip African Teens to Succeed</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">When teens grow up in poverty, staying focused in school can be tough.  But those who do and work hard have the best chance of changing their lives for the better.  Infinite Family works with African teens from badly under-resourced communities where most are left behind.  We provide the tech access and support they need to thrive in the 21st century.  And our ground-breaking video mentorship program helps them develop the skills, resilience, and motivation to make their way in the world.</narrative>
  </description>
